[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18554.39, "timestamp": "05:09:14", "text": "パラジウムの破片を集めるために、地道に努力しなければならない。   たくさん持っているって教えてくれても"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18556.31, "timestamp": "05:09:16", "text": "よかったのに"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18558.15, "timestamp": "05:09:18", "text": "。   ついさっきまでそこにいたんです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18560.282, "timestamp": "05:09:20", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18561.83, "timestamp": "05:09:21", "text": "[笑い]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18566.788, "timestamp": "05:09:26", "text": "ああ、それなら少し貸してもらえませんか？   わかった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18569.43, "timestamp": "05:09:29", "text": "、今から君の家に行くよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18571.51, "timestamp": "05:09:31", "text": "ええ、一塁に立つことができますよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18574.55, "timestamp": "05:09:34", "text": "。 大丈夫です。 いや、二塁のことだよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18577.67, "timestamp": "05:09:37", "text": "私はそこへ行くつもりです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18578.628, "timestamp": "05:09:38", "text": "石が必要だ。 ああ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18581.19, "timestamp": "05:09:41", "text": "あなたは今どこにいますか？ 私はそこにいた。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18582.15, "timestamp": "05:09:42", "text": "私の主要拠点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18588.708, "timestamp": "05:09:48", "text": "ああ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18591.83, "timestamp": "05:09:51", "text": "そうだ、君の基地の近くにあるやつだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18593.43, "timestamp": "05:09:53", "text": "それで"}]